'''Snowflake''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 8th tier in the Lumber Yard during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is icy blue with white snowflakes varying in different sizes imprinted all over it, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia==
*It has a [[Snowflake Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 18, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2659487736/Snowflake-Knife here].

